Deadweight is an original work inspired by the physics-sandbox genre and in
particular by ZombieSmash! (GameDoctors / Zynga, 2012). It contains no code,
art, audio, or other assets from that or any other game; all visuals are
drawn procedurally with the Canvas 2D API and all audio is synthesised at
runtime with the Web Audio API. Deadweight is not affiliated with, endorsed
by, or sponsored by Zynga Inc. or GameDoctors. All third-party trademarks are
the property of their respective owners.

